--Description / thinking process:
--  • Objective: replicate the original intention—return the single lowest‑p‑value
--    variant for every (gene_id, study_id) pair—without triggering a warehouse
--    timeout.
--  • Bottleneck in the failed query: ROW_NUMBER executed over ~hundreds of
